WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.289 --> 00:00:04.755
ZEMO
Super soldiers.

00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:09.836
Gods amongst real people.

00:00:09.836 --> 00:00:13.347
They cannot be allowed to exist.

00:00:15.566 --> 00:00:17.267
ZEMO
I will not stop.

00:00:18.331 --> 00:00:19.937
I will escalate.

00:00:20.691 --> 00:00:23.023
I have the will
to complete this mission.

00:00:25.277 --> 00:00:26.555
Do the two of you?

